#nop ── cleric.tin ── read while the cleric's session is current ────────
#nop
#nop The cleric is why the crew survives a bad room. @panic{} in core.tin
#nop fires on the vitals line, which judymud sends every round, and casts
#nop $heal[$session] — so the cleric is the only character that has one.
#nop
#nop At level 1 a cleric has `cure light` and nothing else worth casting:
#nop `cause light` is level 2 and `armor` is level 3. Both are named here
#nop anyway. core.tin reaches for them, is told "not yet learned enough",
#nop falls back to melee, and reaches again at every level gained.

#variable {role[$session]}      {cleric}
#variable {atk[$session]}       {cast 'cause light'}
#variable {atkspell[$session]}  {cause light}
#variable {heal[$session]}      {cure light}
#variable {buffspell[$session]} {armor}
#variable {wimpy[$session]}     {25}
#variable {isleader[$session]}    {}
